  "display_fullname": "Boosts Attuned Guardians Gift F Attuned Guardians Gift F",
  "display_help": "UNIQUE -- No more than 1 enhancement of this type may be slotted by a character.  This enhancement boosts the effectiveness of Resolve.  While attacking the power slotted with this enhancement has a chance to trigger a PBAoE Resolve around the caster, even if the foe has not yet been defeated.  Additionally, this effect stacks with other Resolve effects.  This power effect can stack Resolve up to 4 times.  Additionally, this enhancement reduces recharge time by {Boost.Attrib.Recharge.Scale}%.  This enhancement can only be slotted by Guardians and may be slotted into any of their damage powers.",
